  activate MongoDB
  MongoDB --> VoucherModel: 13. createdDoc
  deactivate MongoDB
  VoucherModel--> VoucherController : 13.1 created voucher
deactivate VoucherModel
  VoucherController --> VoucherRoutes : 13.1.1 res.status(201).json({data: voucher})
deactivate VoucherController
  VoucherRoutes --> VoucherPage: 13.1.2 201 Created (new voucher)
  deactivate VoucherModel

deactivate VoucherRoutes
end


VoucherPage--> Admin : 14. Show toast & refresh list
deactivate VoucherPage
deactivate Admin

